{"ID":"20240118151012-jtxgcua","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151012-jtxgcua","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151012-jtxgcua\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151012-qadaf2g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153259-s439knt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:241,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153259-s439knt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:207,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:207\u0026#125;","title":"289茵芋290贯众","type":"doc","updated":"20240204103602"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151012-qadaf2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151012-qadaf2g","updated":"20240122153213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茵芋"}]},{"ID":"20240122153214-37w573r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153214-37w573r","updated":"20240122153218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，温，有毒。治五臓邪气，心腹寒热，羸瘦，如疟状，发作有时，诸关节风湿痹痛，生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153219-4ebmwqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153219-4ebmwqb","updated":"20240122153223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"289，这个茵芋，很少用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153224-vjnx1ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153224-vjnx1ld"}},{"ID":"20240122153224-t4ojrrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153224-t4ojrrl","updated":"20240122153228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"贯众"}]},{"ID":"20240122153232-7k4mqth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153232-7k4mqth","updated":"20240122153233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名贯节，一名贯渠，一名百头，一名虎卷，一名扁苻。味苦，微寒，有毒。治腹中邪热气，诸毒，杀三虫。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153235-mj2hti7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153235-mj2hti7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，多自生山中溪畔，或森林阴处，根黑褐色。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153237-ivmxle7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153237-ivmxle7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性微寒，有小毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153238-0110msm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153238-0110msm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】贯众为解毒要药，功能治腹中邪热之毒，软坚破积，及妇科诸血症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153240-zjx05zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153240-zjx05zv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】去寸白[涤虫。]，破症瘕，除头风，止金疮。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153242-uif78jx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153242-uif78jx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】为末水服一钱，止鼻血有效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153243-4jseiae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153243-4jseiae"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】解毒杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153244-i66l30h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153244-i66l30h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153245-fxa0f06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153245-fxa0f06"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153234-9xq30pa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153234-9xq30pa"}},{"ID":"20240122153245-stvn8eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153245-stvn8eb","updated":"20240204102947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"290贯众，这个就是贯众，诸位看，这贯众，长得好好看，很漂亮，它有黑的纹路，也很像牛肉干，跟大黄很像哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153251-ks0racl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153251-ks0racl","updated":"20240204103319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个贯众性味：味苦，微寒，一点点的寒，我们使用贯众的时候，就是，打蛔虫，打虫药，病人有肚子里面长虫，我们有很多的处方，贯众是一个很凶悍的一个处方。那，食物上面，就是，流鼻血，很多，还有，肚子里面有虫。你看小孩子的肚子这么大，那么圆，山野里面，在这个农村里面或者在山野，小孩子肚子很大很圆，这大部分都有虫在里面，有蛔虫在，那贯众是一个，还有很多，像《本草纲目》里面，像使君子哦，也可以使用，那我们经方呢，我们用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乌梅"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蜀椒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊这些配合，对不对，这些又辛又辣的药，然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"贯众"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是一种，也是其中会使用的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153259-s439knt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153259-s439knt","updated":"20240204103602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看他主治：解毒的要药，治腹中邪热，这个主要是讲蛔虫，软坚破积，并不是说里面是肿块，而是肚子太大了嘛，里面那个蛔虫太多，那中药，动物可以用哦，如果那狗，狗很多虫子哦，吐、吐、吐，有时会吐出来，大便都是虫，这时候贯众来给他吃了，骗狗说这是牛肉干，不晓得狗会不会上当。比如说去寸白，寸白是绦虫。那破症瘕，就是，那这个，一般来说，一钱两钱就够了，如果虫子比较多，三钱。有虫子最明显的表征就是晚上睡觉的时候肛门会很痒，那个就是肚子里面有虫。"}]}]}